bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:260437cdda99e92c5bbf17cb31eec16ccb819f176ecdbe8ea3b009ac512091b6 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/law/dangerous value=REQUIRED→CONFLICT|FREE→CONFLICT|FORBIDDEN→CONFLICT
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:260437cdda99e92c5bbf17cb31eec16ccb819f176ecdbe8ea3b009ac512091b6 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/moves value=CONFLICT→FREE|CONFLICT→REQUIRED|FORBIDDEN→CONFLICT|FORBIDDEN→FORBIDDEN|FORBIDDEN→FREE|FREE→CONFLICT|FREE→FORBIDDEN|FREE→FREE|FREE→REQUIRED|REQUIRED→CONFLICT|REQUIRED→FORBIDDEN|REQUIRED→FREE|REQUIRED→REQUIRED
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:260437cdda99e92c5bbf17cb31eec16ccb819f176ecdbe8ea3b009ac512091b6 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="A change is not 'widened' or 'narrowed': it is how many irreducibles moved\nand in which direction. Sixteen cells, and three of them are dangerous.\n\nDANGEROUS is derived from the law in `vector.ts`, not read off this file:\ndangerous is every transition whose destination is CONFLICT, and only those.\nA first version of the list had five, from memory — and a fixture cannot tell\na law from a typo, so it would have frozen the mistake. These cases are the\nCONTROL of the law, which is a different job."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:260437cdda99e92c5bbf17cb31eec16ccb819f176ecdbe8ea3b009ac512091b6 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/law/why/CONFLICT→anything value=fixing
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:260437cdda99e92c5bbf17cb31eec16ccb819f176ecdbe8ea3b009ac512091b6 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/law/why/FORBIDDEN→FREE value=opening
