bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:431e304d5444f29acba6ed6e77217653af5f77245ba146bf2a8b305b8cdefc54 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=result role=reads scope=source/arrow/sign value=World
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:431e304d5444f29acba6ed6e77217653af5f77245ba146bf2a8b305b8cdefc54 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * Sign, the ceiling's act that travels: one line at the bound, never a value copied into the cells that rest on it.\n * Each of them reads it up its chain of rest, so signing costs one line and reading costs the depth of rest; a\n * signature the bound already holds tighter is absorbed and stays live, and taking the tighter back reveals it.\n "
