bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:4520465e99747f8d47c104350cf68ca88667eab43972d6a6dd8eeac9a7196747 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=params role=reads scope=source/returns/sufficient value="(cells: readonly Point[], upTo: number, tolerance = 1e-9)"
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:4520465e99747f8d47c104350cf68ca88667eab43972d6a6dd8eeac9a7196747 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * What a scale hides: read coarsely, the origins of many cells pool into one coordinate and may agree there; read\n * finely, each cell answers alone and the agreement opens into the forks the coarser scale held together. The\n * resolution a region is sufficient at is the one past which the figure its origins enclose stops changing.\n "
