bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5ae35d4e1e9a09f57b1ca1852e2278a64259c6fefde318d27371db76f072c6f4 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5ae35d4e1e9a09f57b1ca1852e2278a64259c6fefde318d27371db76f072c6f4 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="Stated as a conjecture: a field of cells with origins and signatures is a game with a referee inside it, and five properties hold in each of five readings of it.\nThe properties: a move is a claim; a claim alone is potential; two that meet are information; a signature moves every cell that rests on it; and no player may suspend the rule that makes the first four.\nNo numbers. What is claimed is that each of the five readings matches all five properties."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5bcb86d8438cc8f4a38bcf2294f25e10cc6cc434955cab09c6249f995ce1ba3f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases|coverage
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5bcb86d8438cc8f4a38bcf2294f25e10cc6cc434955cab09c6249f995ce1ba3f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="(u1,w1) ∧ (u2,w2) = (u1∨u2, w1∧w2).\nDisjunction is the dual."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5c1e33d742ab4a5c50cbe1c32e49813acd2afcbcf107f2bd6a54f4f654fad603 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:5c1e33d742ab4a5c50cbe1c32e49813acd2afcbcf107f2bd6a54f4f654fad603 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="A signature narrows a ceiling and travels to every cell that rests on it as a meet, and meets commute, so the order of any number of signatures never shows in the field they leave.\nWidening is not a meet and does not travel: asking for a wider ceiling leaves the cell where the narrower one put it, which is why an error costs a signature at every cell and a narrowing costs one.\nFolding the field and signing it commute, with a withdrawal present."
