bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:6ed41848d65113ee943aa744877a93fbd283c1dbf4f2b054f3f9299885d3621d by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:6ed41848d65113ee943aa744877a93fbd283c1dbf4f2b054f3f9299885d3621d by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="A gap is not the absence of a claim but a claim at the coarsest resolution: a cell nobody has narrowed holds the whole scale, which is exactly what saying nothing says.\nSo a reading that is missing and a reading that says everything are the same line, and a tree with gaps is a tree read coarsely rather than a tree unread.\nThe cell that holds the whole scale is the lattice top, which is what a gap is."
