bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:84d51cf89ab9bab6600789bb002cbdae915d695a129a338b1f87f80840b76340 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=interval measure=count role=reads scope=source/unread value=0..0
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85d731ed55881282f8885dad986ee1fa5872b787fcab9829549c1c7f22bab757 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases|chain|composition|coverage|orders|product
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85d731ed55881282f8885dad986ee1fa5872b787fcab9829549c1c7f22bab757 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="`a` entails `b`: everything satisfying `a` satisfies `b`.\n\nTwo comparisons and no search. `b`'s demand sits under `a`'s, and\n`a`'s limit under `b`'s — the direction reverses between the two\nmarks, and an implementation that compares both the same way passes\nthe reflexive cases and fails the rest.\n\nThe product order: a non-maximal cross does not explode. Only the\nstrongest cross (top floor, bottom ceiling) still entails every\nother generated-by-one pair."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85e83636a1a11e4b3c308c564d3337cf47d93a93e2e769b9913988407bf5c26f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|brief|cases|title
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85e83636a1a11e4b3c308c564d3337cf47d93a93e2e769b9913988407bf5c26f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="Stated as a conjecture: the cells under the order of rest, with signatures as meets and phase as what each origin carries, look like an enriched meet-semilattice, and what the library proves would be its representation theory.\nWhat can be checked is checked here: identity, composition, associativity, commuting and naturality hold for the operations as vectors.\nObservation is not one of them. It moves the metric — a cell two steps away becomes one — and it can split a cell that no signature could, which is why it is a functor out of the category and not an arrow inside it."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85e83636a1a11e4b3c308c564d3337cf47d93a93e2e769b9913988407bf5c26f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/brief value="cells under rest, signatures as meets, phase as enrichment"
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:85e83636a1a11e4b3c308c564d3337cf47d93a93e2e769b9913988407bf5c26f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/title value="Enriched semilattice"
