bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:87b301a7a036b09a1c48e47574f9f11bd73555e77d95688f4c51a4a69fbf5d0e by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=result role=reads scope=source/arrow/price value=number
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:87b301a7a036b09a1c48e47574f9f11bd73555e77d95688f4c51a4a69fbf5d0e by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * The price of a claim and the one who pays it. A claim costs the bits it closes where it lands, and it is paid by its\n * origin: the observer is a cell like any other, its ceiling the looks it has left, and every act it takes is a meet\n * on that ceiling, one look narrower. An origin with no look left cannot act, and nothing else pays for it.\n "
