bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8822c36fb0ac17239fa7c20978f809a346c027dc07515580e096ee3a46562b9b by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="MAY this happen at this level — a DIFFERENT question from does-this-collide,\nand the one a caller actually asks on every call.\n\nIt got its own file because the question asked on every call — may this happen at\nthis level — had no vector, so a surface nobody pinned could drift.\n\nThe trap is the last case. An opinion of `nothing above the bottom` collides\nwith nobody and permits nothing, so a caller checking only for collisions\nreads it as allowed."
