bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8b9c5221d99a106eef0bfc3c8538551c3b88236e13a120501dfe0a40fad8f92c by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=result role=reads scope=source/arrow/observe value=Obligatory
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8b9c5221d99a106eef0bfc3c8538551c3b88236e13a120501dfe0a40fad8f92c by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * Observe, the floor's act on one cell: one more claim, from an origin, at an epoch. At s = −1 it is the withdrawal, the\n * same act taken back: a line that names the claim it takes by its id, so the cell returns to what it held without it,\n * every claim stays on it, and nothing is matched by looking like something.\n "
