bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8c907a156d5cdfbec6591fb8c5c5e03a1f59b0fbfa39a9b244e04d360294d7b7 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="What would break T93, run against the object."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8c9171636c4fc270e69db47e62aad6625ffb08aa62e2409afa2f8382b7dcc5fd by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8c9171636c4fc270e69db47e62aad6625ffb08aa62e2409afa2f8382b7dcc5fd by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="Freedom is log₂ of the states between the poles and the entropy of a uniform choice among them; four thousand fields under a narrowing act never gain a bit, and every withdrawal gives back what its claim closed.\nTwo routes at one span interfere by phase alone: full contrast unseen, almost none once each route is kicked by an observation."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8cc83d91af4ccecd3ae0171cd8b0c49b6dbf7d21ff1888b53d519afd1e46fe0f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|then|witness
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:8cc83d91af4ccecd3ae0171cd8b0c49b6dbf7d21ff1888b53d519afd1e46fe0f by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="obligations/src holds lattice/ (the price: declaration, cost, premium, degeneration, blocks, axioms, forms), debit/ (the debit: four states, ideals, register, vectors, standing, the packed two-mask carrier) and field/ (the field: point, region, within, resolution, passes, coarsen, vacuity, encounter, present, drift, size, sufficient resolution, replay, signatures-as-meet), laws/laws.bound and replay.ts. laws.bound states 75 laws, each with its vector. offers.bound names 134 operations with their extension; every operation of field/ names at least one vector. The field vectors run against field/: questions 3/3, sufficient-resolution 2/2, present-meet 4/4, present-convergence 4/4. Nothing in field/ names an instrument, a file or a landing."
