bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:91db498092051edf19d55796561f7768455611123c14d7b121934d436477c463 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=result role=reads scope=source/arrow/meet value=T
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:91db498092051edf19d55796561f7768455611123c14d7b121934d436477c463 by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * Meet, the ceiling's act on one cell: what its floor, its ceiling and its live claims hold together in the lattice it\n * is given. It narrows and never travels; the order the lines arrived in never shows, except where a witnessed join\n * widened the ceiling between two signatures.\n "
