bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:b195f84fca592b4d3537203ea91eacfa363db1b119d00417a9cdb3142ebd72e8 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases|coverage
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:b195f84fca592b4d3537203ea91eacfa363db1b119d00417a9cdb3142ebd72e8 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="pack ∘ unpack = id on the image of pack iff the scale is distributive.\nunpack ∘ pack = id on every finite lattice. coherent is the four masks\nagreeing under incidence.\n\nThe trap: asserting pack and unpack are exact inverses without\ndistinguishing direction. On M3, and(pack(a), pack(b)) unpacks to top\nand packing top adds the third atom. The mask {a,b} is not in the\nimage of pack."
