bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:f2ebf3363f0b0df5d06a5887e4c23270578315eb33be1e6903122da9e4e7c4f5 by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="thm-mi on the product of two subsystems: demand the first answerable, forbid the state to exceed the second.\nThe conflict is H(X), the retreat H(X|Y), and the premium of planning their difference — the mutual information.\nEach factor is a chain, so neither factor prices anything on its own."
