bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fa586a0bad5e76dc71b84f52426014eee56f00d54d1da1a77fdf2fa0d843cd9e by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=params role=reads scope=source/returns/play value="(lattice: Lattice<Band>, world: readonly Obligatory<Band>[], weights: Weights, epochs: number, seed: number, spread: number)"
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fa586a0bad5e76dc71b84f52426014eee56f00d54d1da1a77fdf2fa0d843cd9e by=reader:76e1db421edb form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=source/head value="\n * A policy is four weights and nothing else: what a cell is worth to look at next is its reach, how together its\n * claims arrived, what rests on it and what it still leaves free, each taken as it stands and added under the weights\n * a policy carries. A specialist is a policy with one weight; a mixed policy is one with four.\n "
