bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fa586a0bad5e76dc71b84f52426014eee56f00d54d1da1a77fdf2fa0d843cd9e by=reader:76e1db421edb form=interval measure=count role=reads scope=source/unread value=0..0
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fabf9c4efbcc800a4f166dddd0a5173c292a0e8de16844ae6a4eec9ee6e9e50e by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fabf9c4efbcc800a4f166dddd0a5173c292a0e8de16844ae6a4eec9ee6e9e50e by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="Stated as a conjecture: what carries an encounter is a medium, and a medium is what two origins can both reach.\nIn each of the four instruments the medium is named, and in each the encounter happens where two origins touch that medium and not elsewhere.\nNo numbers. What is claimed is that naming the medium is always possible and always the same move."
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fd2d736c46dbc735dc1cc1954a46a34ec26be30c0cf85d92075d2acb892a68cb by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=said/fields value=about|cases|coverage
bound-lock/1 at=place:sha256:fd2d736c46dbc735dc1cc1954a46a34ec26be30c0cf85d92075d2acb892a68cb by=reader:95297fcf0823 form=alphabet measure=text role=reads scope=said/about value="The points every reading over forms takes: for each offered form, the parameters of its lattice, a seed and how many points.\nThe checker runs over them, and over three broken copies of each lattice: its meet taken as its join, its order reversed, and one law removed by taking its top as its bottom. A copy the checker passes is a form the checker cannot see."
